<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings - wk ended March 8.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings - wk ended March 8.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		Pct Change   Week Ending:	   Year-Ago</p>
<p>    -		   In Week---03/08/97  03/01/97     Week</p>
<p> Grain		    -4.0	25,274    26,328    29,279</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   0.9	 9,915     9,823     9,292</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  -1.5	 1,281     1,300     1,132</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	  10.9	16,874    15,210    16,555</p>
</text>
